  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### Auto Tax Code- Payroll\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 21 Apr, 2023 at  3:24 PM\n\n\t\tNavigation:\n\nManage Payroll > Auto tax code > Update tax code \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nCapium will now automatically pick up any changes made to the tax code at the start of a new tax year and update. To connect Capium to HMRC navigate into: Manage payroll > Auto tax code \n\nTo authorise Capium click on 'Update tax code'.\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\n1. Navigate to Manage Payroll & Auto Tax code & then enter your HMRC PAYE credentials to pull tax code information into Capium. \n\n2. Navigate to Manage Payroll & Auto Tax code & then click 'Update tax code'\n\n3. Then you select the tax codes you want to update the employee records & then click 'Apply'\n\nThe employees tax code will then be updated with the new tax code directly from HMRC.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
